Careful: load() has the "已是最新" toast — that would toast every minute. Adjust: auto-refresh should toast only on update. Modify load({silent}) param: silent skips toast. Add `silent` param; auto path uses load({silent:true}).

Also the tab-slate element id: index.html has `<div id="tab-slate">`. Check visibility: hidden attribute.

