Should ingest store live scores? That changes semantics of games table (scores for unfinished games) — settle uses completed only. Showing live scores on board is nice but the live tab covers it. Keep as is; the user's complaint was the panel not updating status — fixed by per-tick ingest.

Also note the bets page: phone board updates every 5 min via watch push + auto-refresh every 60s.

Now implement app.js auto-refresh + silent toast, restart watch, rebuild APK, reinstall, verify status flips to IN_PROGRESS after a tick.

