Now the frontend:

1. app.js renderGames: live score display. Current `score` computation uses home_score/away_score. Add:
```js
const live = game.live_home_score != null && game.live_away_score != null && info.cls === "live";
const score = (game.home_score != null && game.away_score != null)
  ? `<span class="score">${game.away_score} : ${game.home_score}</span>`
  : live ? `<span class="score live-score">${game.live_away_score} : ${game.live_home_score}</span>` : "";
```
statusInfo: STATUS_IN_PROGRESS → live cls ✓.

2. Modal open-bet live status (betRows in renderModal): compute per open bet:
```js
function betLiveState(bet, game) {
  const hs = game.live_home_score ?? game.home_score;
  const as = game.live_away_score ?? game.away_score;
  if (hs == null || as == null || game.status !== "STATUS_IN_PROGRESS") return null;
  const margin = hs - as, total = hs + as;
  if (bet.market === "moneyline") return ((bet.side === "home") === margin > 0) ? "赢" : "落后";
  if (bet.market === "spread") {
    const homeLine = bet.side === "home" ? Number(bet.line||0) : -Number(bet.line||0);
    const diff = margin + homeLine;
    if (Math.abs(diff) < 1e-9) return "走盘线";
    return ((bet.side === "home") === diff > 0) ? "目前赢盘" : "目前输盘";
  }
  if (bet.market === "total") {
    if (Math.abs(total - Number(bet.line||0)) < 1e-9) return "贴线";
    return ((bet.side === "over") === total > Number(bet.line)) ? "目前赢盘" : "目前输盘";
  }
  return null;
}
```
Note (bet.side==="home") === diff > 0 precedence — parenthesize as before.

Display in betRows: append `<span class="pill">${liveText}</span>` with live color.

Careful: game object in renderModal is the API payload (game) — has live_home_score after api change; in static mode, payload board games include live_home_score (export from _game_payload ✓).

